@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceParticipant roundCorner 0
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title Использование одноразового бонуса

participant OneTimeBonusEvent as Event
participant Hero
participant Inventory
participant OneTimeBonus as Bonus
Event -> Hero: use_one_timer(index)
Hero -> Inventory: get_one_time_bonuses()
Inventory --> Hero: итератор предметов
Hero -> Hero: выбрать bonus по index
Hero -> Inventory: use_one_timer(index)
Inventory -> Inventory: удалить предмет
Hero -> Bonus: get_modifier()
Bonus --> Hero: modifier: ActorParams
Hero -> Hero: params = params + modifier
@enduml
